flowchart TB
Dev[dev source changes] --> Review[Reviewdog static review and publication hygiene]
Review --> CI[Unit integration browser builds and security scanning]
CI --> Stage[Reviewed PR to staging]
Stage --> Bridge[Portal and AI deploy.yml staging bridge]
Stage --> Robot[Robot release-candidate.yml staging bridge]
Bridge --> VS[Vercel protected Preview and Render staging APIs]
Robot --> VS
Stage --> ARM[scripts/oracle_worker.py qualified ARM64 rollout]
ARM --> Oracle[Oracle synthetic staging worker and ClamAV]
VS --> Acceptance[Hosted E2E identity ownership persistence]
Oracle --> Acceptance
CF[Actual Cloudflare generation and embedding tests] --> Acceptance
Acceptance --> Gates[CODE_VERIFIED STAGING_VERIFIED OPERATIONS_VERIFIED CONTENT_LEGAL_APPROVED]
Gates --> Owner[Single authorized owner decision - accepted]
Owner --> Main[Qualified PR staging to main]
Main --> Prod[Vercel Render qualified Oracle and separate docs deploys]
Prod --> Verify[Exact revision readiness hosted tests and monitoring]
CI --> Fail[FAIL - fix on dev and re-run]
Acceptance --> Fail
Verify --> Recovery[Stop unsafe processing and restore previous qualified artifacts]
Recovery --> Investigate[Preserve evidence and investigate before requalification]
Runner[Private-only local runner option - dormant] -. no private-Free protection claim .-> CI

Security[Dependency alert and temporary security-fix PR] --> BotCI[Credential-free hosted PR checks and owner review]
BotCI --> Dev
BotCI --> Urgent[Urgent candidate from exact current production and reviewed fix only]
Urgent --> Feasible{Existing staging can advance without unrelated work?}
Feasible -->|yes| Isolated[Existing isolated staging qualification - no new permanent environment]
Feasible -->|no| Blocked[Direct temporary qualification not implemented - preserve work]
Isolated --> Gates
Verify --> Reconcile[Reconcile reviewed security fix into dev and staging]
Reconcile --> Cleanup[Temporary branch cleanup only after incorporation and evidence checks]
